{"strongs": "H5098", "word": "נָהַם", "translit": "na.ham", "root": "נהם", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "growl, groan", "definition": "[ נָהַם ] verb growl, groan (Late Hebrew id.; Arabic ; Aramaic , נְהַם ); — Qal Perfect וְנָהַמְתָּ֫ Prov 5:11 וּנְהַמְתֶּם Ezek 24:23 Imperfect יִנְהֹם Isa 5:29 ; Isa 5:30 Participle נֹהֵם Prov 28:15 — 1. growl , of a lion (namely while it is devouring its prey: opposed to שׁאנ , of roar with which it springs upon it RS Proph. 243 ) Prov 28:15 , of Assyr. (under figure of lion) Isa 5:29 followed by עַל ( over ), v Isa 5:30 . 2. groan , of sufferer Prov 5:11 ; Ezek 24:23 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5019')\">BDB5019</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5098')\">H5098</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5018')\">BDB5018</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5020')\">BDB5020</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>נָהַם</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>growl, groan</highlightword> (Late Hebrew id.; Arabic <placeholder3200/>; Aramaic <placeholder3201/>, <bdbheb>נְהַם</bdbheb>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וְנָהַמְתָּ֫</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 5:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,5,11)\">Prov 5:11</ref> <bdbheb>וּנְהַמְתֶּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,23)\">Ezek 24:23</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִנְהֹם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:29\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,29)\">Isa 5:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 5:30\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,30)\">Isa 5:30</ref> <b>Participle</b> <bdbheb>נֹהֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 28:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,15)\">Prov 28:15</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>growl</highli